{"title":"Volunteer as a Docent","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Volunteer as a Docent","toc":false,"page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"content-section cream-bg\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner cta-section\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Get Involved</p>\n    <h2>Ready to Make Someone's First JSM Great?</h2>\n    <p>Sign up below and we'll have everything ready for you at registration.</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"signup-form-wrap\">\n      <form action=\"https://amstat.jotform.com/team/meetings/jsm-docent\" method=\"POST\">\n        <div class=\"form-row\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"fname\">First Name</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"fname\" name=\"first_name\" placeholder=\"Jane\" required>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"lname\">Last Name</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"lname\" name=\"last_name\" placeholder=\"Doe\" required>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <label for=\"email\">Email Address</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"jane@example.com\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <label for=\"About Yourself\">Areas of Interest <span style=\"font-weight:300;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;\">(optional)</span></label>\n          <textarea id=\"interests\" name=\"interests\" placeholder=\"E.g., applied statistics, data visualization, education, biostatistics...\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary-custom\">Sign Me Up as a Docent</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-section white-bg\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">What Happens Next</p>\n    <h2>After You Sign Up</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"card-grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">01</div>\n        <h3>Confirmation Email</h3>\n        <p>You'll receive an email confirming your registration as a docent, along with details about the orientation session schedule and where to pick up your kit.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">02</div>\n        <h3>Pre-Conference Reminder</h3>\n        <p>A week before JSM, we'll send a reminder with final details — orientation time and location, registration desk instructions, and any last-minute updates.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature-card\">\n        <div class=\"step-number\">03</div>\n        <h3>Conference Day</h3>\n        <p>Pick up your ribbon and button at the registration desk, attend the orientation, and enjoy the conference knowing you're making a real difference for newcomers.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content-section cream-bg\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner cta-section\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Spread the Word</p>\n    <h2>Know Someone Who'd Be a Great Docent?</h2>\n    <p>Share this page with experienced colleagues and friends. The more docents we have, the more welcoming our conference becomes.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"content-section cream-bg\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;\">\n  <div class=\"section-inner cta-section\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Get Involved</p>\n    <h2>Ready to Make Someone's First JSM Great?</h2>\n    <p>Sign up below and we'll have everything ready for you at registration.</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"signup-form-wrap\">\n      <form action=\"https://amstat.jotform.com/team/meetings/jsm-docent\" method=\"POST\">\n        <div class=\"form-row\">\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"fname\">First Name</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"fname\" name=\"first_name\" placeholder=\"Jane\" required>\n          